<ContentLayout title="About TokenCalculator.dev" description="Why TokenCalculator.dev measures LLM tokens locally and labels estimates honestly." heading="About"><p>TokenCalculator.dev helps developers measure prompt size, API cost, and context fit before calling an LLM.</p><h2>Tokenizer methodology</h2><p>OpenAI-family text uses js-tiktoken with the o200k_base encoding. Claude, Gemini, and DeepSeek use deterministic calibrated estimates because equivalent offline browser tokenizers are not published. Every model row labels the method used.</p><h2>Open model data</h2><p>Current pricing and context limits are refreshed from the open-source <a href="https://models.dev/">Models.dev</a> catalog. A bundled registry keeps the calculator usable when that public catalog cannot be reached.</p></ContentLayout>
